  ],
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "verse-001",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 1,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:1",
      "numberLabel": "1",
      "text": "Paul, and Silvanus, and Timotheus, unto the church of the Thessalonians which is in God the Father and in the Lord Jesus Christ: Grace be unto you, and peace, from God our Father, and the Lord Jesus Christ.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 1:1",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-002",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 2,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:2",
      "numberLabel": "2",
      "text": "We give thanks to God always for you all, making mention of you in our prayers;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 1:2",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-003",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 3,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:3",
      "numberLabel": "3",
      "text": "Remembering without ceasing your work of faith, and labour of love, and patience of hope in our Lord Jesus Christ, in the sight of God and our Father;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 1:3",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-004",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 4,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:4",
      "numberLabel": "4",
      "text": "Knowing, brethren beloved, your election of God.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 1:4",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-005",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 5,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:5",
      "numberLabel": "5",
      "text": "For our gospel came not unto you in word only, but also in power, and in the Holy Ghost, and in much assurance; as ye know what manner of men we were among you for your sake.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 1:5",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:5"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-006",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 6,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:6",
      "numberLabel": "6",
      "text": "And ye became followers of us, and of the Lord, having received the word in much affliction, with joy of the Holy Ghost:",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 1:6",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-007",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 7,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:7",
      "numberLabel": "7",
      "text": "So that ye were ensamples to all that believe in Macedonia and Achaia.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 1:7",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-008",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 8,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:8",
      "numberLabel": "8",
      "text": "For from you sounded out the word of the Lord not only in Macedonia and Achaia, but also in every place your faith to God-ward is spread abroad; so that we need not to speak any thing.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 1:8",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-009",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 9,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:9",
      "numberLabel": "9",
      "text": "For they themselves shew of us what manner of entering in we had unto you, and how ye turned to God from idols to serve the living and true God;",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 1:9",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "verse-010",
      "type": "bible_verse",
      "verse": 10,
      "verseId": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:10",
      "numberLabel": "10",
      "text": "And to wait for his Son from heaven, whom he raised from the dead, even Jesus, which delivered us from the wrath to come.",
      "metadata": {
        "reference": "1 Thessalonians 1:10",
        "verseKey": "kjv:1-thessalonians:1:10"
      }
    }
  ],
